1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:06,233
Walt drives the three of you to Hollow
Mile in Bus 9. He hangs his old
lantern on the platform post.

2
00:00:06,733 --> 00:00:12,800
Rule one. Stand behind the yellow
line. Let the train come to you. Never
step toward the dark.

3
00:00:13,300 --> 00:00:20,233
11:59. No sound. No light on the
rails. Then the air moves, cold and
fast, and the train is simply there.
